# Real ADB binary fetched by setup.py — not committed. The repo deliberately
# ships no working ADB (see README: bundling adb.exe with an unsigned script trips
# antivirus heuristics), and adb/adb is a Linux/macOS binary in a Windows repo.
adb/adb

